<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. TAKE UNBEATABLE 3-1 DAVIS CUP LEAD.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. TAKE UNBEATABLE 3-1 DAVIS CUP LEAD.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, California 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States took an unbeatable 3-1 lead in their Davis Cup quarter-final tie against the Netherlands on Sunday:</p>
<p>Singles:</p>
<p>Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Jan Siemerink (the Netherlands) 3-6 3-6 6-3 6-3 6-3</p>
</text>
